1
00:00:00,914 --> 00:00:02,294
(Sheldon:)Hello, Stuart.

2
00:00:02,457 --> 00:00:04,837
(Stuart:)Oh, hey, Sheldon.
Can I help you find something today?

3
00:00:05,418 --> 00:00:07,798
(Sheldon:)No, I was just sitting at home...

4
00:00:07,962 --> 00:00:11,922
(Sheldon:)...thinking about how it might be nice
to catch up with my ninth-favorite person.

5
00:00:12,592 --> 00:00:14,842
- Ninth?
- You moved up one.

6
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:18,600
(Sheldon:)My pen pal in Somalia
was kidnapped by pirates.

7
00:00:20,683 --> 00:00:22,313
(Sheldon:)So, uh, how are you?

8
00:00:22,852 --> 00:00:26,942
(Stuart:)Uh, not so good.
My shrink just killed himseIf...

9
00:00:27,607 --> 00:00:29,397
(Stuart:)...and blamed me in the note.

10
00:00:31,986 --> 00:00:33,986
(Sheldon:)Great, great.

11
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,660
(Sheldon:)So, what's new with your family?
How's your mother? Ls she alive?

12
00:00:39,827 --> 00:00:41,117
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

13
00:00:41,287 --> 00:00:44,827
- Your father. Alive?
- Yes.

14
00:00:44,999 --> 00:00:48,749
- How about your grandparents, they alive?
- No.

15
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:51,460
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'm so sorry for your loss.

16
00:00:51,631 --> 00:00:56,091
(Sheldon:)On a cheerier note, I have a teeth-cleaning
appointment this afternoon.

17
00:00:56,261 --> 00:01:00,021
(Sheldon:)What do you say you take me over there,
buddy boy?

